.SH RETURN VALUE
These routines return the integer \fBERR\fP upon failure and \fBOK\fP
.PP
In this implementation
.RS 3
.TP 5
\fBwnoutrefresh\fP
returns
.B ERR
if the window pointer is null, or
if the window is really a pad.
.TP 5
\fBwredrawln\fP
return
.B ERR
if the associated call to \fBtouchln\fP returns
.BR ERR "."
.RE
